<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Sept 19.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Sept 19.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain</p>
<p>trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Southampton, Tewkesbury,</p>
<p>Avonmouth and Gloucester Oct/Dec 129.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to West Norfolk Sep 106.00</p>
<p>Suffolk/Essex Oct/Dec 111.00</p>
<p>Avon Sep 107.00/07.50/08.00 Oct/Dec 109.50/10.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Jan/Mar 113.50</p>
<p>Nottinghamshire Oct 106.50</p>
<p>Leicester Nov 107.00</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire Jan/Mar 110.00</p>
<p>Southampton Sep 108.00</p>
<p>Feed barley Suffolk/Essex Oct/Dec 106.50/07.00/07.50 Jan/Mar 110.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Jan/Mar 109.50</p>
<p>Avon Oct/Dec 107.00/06.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Sep 104.00</p>
</text>
